.TH NN-FORMATS 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-formats \- show registered format capabilities
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn formats [name]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List formats and whether they can read, expose a graph, weights, execute, or convert. Execute is yes only when a runtime was actually linked.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn formats onnx
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-backends(1), nn-doctor(1)
